%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":" <strong>seqpdist<\/strong> - Calculate pairwise distance between sequences\n\n    <strong>Syntax<\/strong>\n      D = seqpdist(Seqs)\n      D = seqpdist(Seqs,Name=Value)\n\n    <strong>Input Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_619605ab-8a85-4377-ac60-e719e0cfcd4e')\">Seqs<\/a> - Nucleotide or amino acid sequences\n        cell array of character vectors | vector of strings |\n        matrix of characters | vector of structures\n\n    <strong>Name-Value Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_872ae41b-59ee-4ed3-bf0f-4cbdad71031b')\">Method<\/a> - Method to calculate pairwise distances\n        \"Jukes-Cantor\" (default) | character vector | string scalar |\n        function handle\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_7048e6c8-6e28-4cd1-ac86-7b0f90f7124c')\">Indels<\/a> - How to treat sites with gaps\n        \"score\" (default) | \"pairwise-del\" | \"complete-del\"\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_b7749102-0d11-4602-90a2-8bed35cfa88d')\">OptArgs<\/a> - Optional arguments for distance method\n        numeric scalar | four-element numeric vector\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_09a1cb1f-9657-47bb-8cd2-34da4b13429b')\">PairwiseAlignment<\/a> - Global pairwise alignment\n        true or 1 | false or 0\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_37c1bf61-b036-452c-b2d7-f5f5d7ad853f')\">UseParallel<\/a> - Option to perform computations in parallel\n        \"off\" (default) | \"auto\" | \"on\"\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_88b8a4ff-ea04-4b63-a7a5-635d5cdb506e')\">SquareForm<\/a> - Return output as square matrix\n        false or 0 (default) | true or 1\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_6e8d3dcf-6907-4993-908e-e427453d452a')\">Alphabet<\/a> - Type of sequence\n        \"AA\" (default) | \"NT\"\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_ad5235fc-f1bb-4c20-960e-206cd1daba1a')\">ScoringMatrix<\/a> - Scoring matrix\n        character vector | string scalar | numeric matrix\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_5eced358-a9fc-4e0f-8268-aeabf5aaaf17')\">Scale<\/a> - Scale factor applied to output distance\n        1 (default) | positive number\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_a7ef88cb-4b60-4ff5-bde5-72c1a811a139')\">GapOpen<\/a> - Penalty for opening gap\n        8 (default) | positive integer\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_ad3f9ffd-bd50-43a3-88dc-f04a96df1c77')\">ExtendGap<\/a> - Penalty for extending gap\n        positive integer\n\n    <strong>Output Arguments<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:web('C:\\Program Files\\MATLAB\\R2026b\\help\/bioinfo\/ref\/seqpdist.html#mw_597710cf-1a90-463a-9ba7-97804ec19d6d')\">D<\/a> - Biological distance between all pairs of sequences\n        numeric row vector | numeric matrix\n\n    <strong>Examples<\/strong>\n      <a href=\"matlab:openExample('bioinfo\/MeasureDistanceBetweenAminoAcidSequencesExample')\">Measure Distance Between Amino Acid Sequences<\/a>\n\n    <strong>See also<\/strong> <a href=\"matlab:help fastaread -displayBanner\">fastaread<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help dnds -displayBanner\">dnds<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help dndsml -displayBanner\">dndsml<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help multialign -displayBanner\">multialign<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help nwalign -displayBanner\">nwalign<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help phytree -displayBanner\">phytree<\/a>,\n      <a href=\"matlab:help seqlinkage -displayBanner\">seqlinkage<\/a>, <a href=\"matlab:help phytree.pdist -displayBanner\">pdist<\/a>\n\n    Introduced in Bioinformatics Toolbox before R2006a\n    <a href=\"matlab:doc seqpdist\">Documentation for seqpdist<\/a>\n\n","truncated":false}}
